### Explanation of changes:
*   Added a check to filter out duplicate parameters by name.
*   Introduced a `seen_parameter_names` set to keep track of the parameter names that have been added to the `filtered_parameters` list.
*   Modified the loop that extends the `parameters` list to only include parameters whose names are not already in the `seen_parameter_names` set.

